[00:14.74]1. For those who teach the Word of God,
[00:22.34]There is a joyful share.
[00:29.70]The benefits that we receive
[00:37.06]Are far beyond compare.
[00:44.18]We imitate the Son of God
[00:51.42]And how he taught with love.
[00:58.62]And as we teach, the ones we’re helping
[01:05.54]Draw close to God above.
[01:23.54]2. As teachers of Jehovah’s Word,
[01:31.30]We strive to do what’s right,
[01:37.94]So all may see sincerity
[01:44.34]As we reflect God’s light.
[01:53.18]With diligence we search God’s Word,
[02:00.58]For it has news to tell.
[02:06.60]So we can share our heart’s good treasure
[02:14.14]And teach ourselves as well.
[02:33.26]3. Jehovah gives us all we need
[02:40.40]To teach his precious Word.
[02:47.94]So if we pray to ask for help,
[02:54.30]We know that we’ll be heard.
[03:02.34]We love what’s in the Word of God;
[03:08.54]What’s more, we know it’s true.
[03:16.18]And as we love the ones we’re teaching,
[03:23.36]They’ll soon be teachers too!
